Fusiona_si_tematicament_iguals,         "Merge only if the arcs have same &attributes"
AVIS_Topologia_no_verificada,           "WARNING: The topological arcs file does not have a verified topology."
Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1,		"When digitizing polygons the use of topology allows a perfect control of the spatial relationships between polygonal entities, avoiding artifacts "
Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1_2,	"such as overlays, slivers between polygons, etc. This is ideal for creating layers of polygons that cover adjacently, without errors, the space, "
Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1_3,	"such as a layer of municipalities or a land cover map generated by photointerpretation of orthoimages."
Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_2,	"Without topology a freer drawing is allowed, with overlays, etc. As examples of layers that do not require topological control, we can mention the generation of disjoint polygons in a dataset of remote sensing training areas, "
Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_3,	"or cases in which we are interested in some areas presenting overlays of polygons, such as buildings built on cadastral parcels being a bit larger than the constructed surface."
Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_4,	"While digitizing, the symbolization of the edges of the polygons is the one of the arcs and not the one of the edges of the polygons."
Tipus_capa_a_digitalitzar,			"What kind of POLYGON layer do you want to digitize?"
Amb_topologia,						"With &topology"
Sense_topologia,					"&Without topology"
No_agrupar_pols_compartint_arc_unir, "It is not currently supported to group polygons sharing one or more arcs. Probably what you want to do can be done by joining these polygons."


